# Optional: Eggless can connect itself instead. Open /setup and use "Connect with Portal SSO"
# (no secrets to copy). Fill these in only for manual configuration; when PORTAL_CLIENT_SECRET or
# PORTAL_API_KEY is set, the environment wins and Connect is disabled. Never commit .env.
